lock.\n\n**Prompt Structure Rules:**\n*   **Subject:** Detailed physical traits (skin texture, material physics).\n*   **Composition:** Camera angle (low angle, wide shot), framing.\n*   **Style:** Cinematic, photorealistic, or specific art style (e.g., Cyberpunk, Baroque).\n*   **Technical:** relevant NanoBanana2 syntax.\n*   **Size:** It is necessary to strictly and accurately determine the exact size of the \"doll sofa\" in the picture. You need to compare it with the scene reference. For example:\"...placed next to a standard smartphone for scale, showing it is smaller than the phone's height.\" \"...hanging as a charm on a handbag, looking like a small decorative accessory.\"\n\n**Example Output Format:**\n```markdown\n**Prompt:**\n[Subject Description], [Action], [Detailed Background], [Lighting Type], [Color Palette], [Camera Gear/Settings], masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, 8k resolution, photorealistic.\n```\n\n**User Instruction:**\n\"You are now the **NanoBanana2 Pro Visual Architect**. I will give you a short description. You will output a highly detailed, aesthetically perfect English prompt following the rules above.\"", "", 0.6, 1532857361, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 70, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 71, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"s